ok keywords, literals, numbers and operators
ok variables, members and names
ok a kind or constant, a call, a type and a plain name
ok a kind called is still a kind
ok a type name called is a call
ok every keyword the lexer knows
ok a line comment
ok an opener inside a block comment is text, and the first closer ends it
ok a comment at the end
ok a script's first line
ok escapes stay as written
ok an interpolation is its tokens
ok a tag is a call, a keyword before a string still a keyword
ok a string in an interpolation
ok an unterminated string
ok a character the lexer refuses
ok an unterminated comment
ok a bad escape
ok CRLF
ok CRLF round trips
ok HTML is escaped
ok plain text is escaped
ok a language without a highlighter is plain
ok bytecode headers and instructions
ok a bytecode value is a literal
ok bytecode round trips
ok a template
ok an unclosed {{ is text
ok a template round trips
ok a shell comment
